    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/4550d81605abc40cf849370182fb08df.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/4550d81605abc40cf849370182fb08df.apng?t=1755015476\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span>DAY OF DRIFT is a top - down arcade - style drifting racing game. You need to achieve a higher drifting score within a limited time to clear the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/557214a7adb3a6d2399bc806cc85ac9b.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/557214a7adb3a6d2399bc806cc85ac9b.webm?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/557214a7adb3a6d2399bc806cc85ac9b.mp4?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/32a43d3bcf9e264c015b805f95daae87.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/32a43d3bcf9e264c015b805f95daae87.apng?t=1755015476\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span>Use simple operations to make the racing car perform gorgeous drifting maneuvers. Reasonable braking and steering during turns will bring you a higher drifting score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/d39f0465b7d128d8b59ac823f3664ef7.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/d39f0465b7d128d8b59ac823f3664ef7.webm?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/d39f0465b7d128d8b59ac823f3664ef7.mp4?t=1755015476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/69e2dd7c7fa2909c3281f175da8dfc5a.poster.avif?t=1755015476\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650050/extras/69e2dd7c7fa2909c3281f175da8dfc5a.apng?t=1755015476\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span>1,60 meticulously designed tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,Retro audio - visual effects, restoring the gaming experience of 90s consoles/arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3,Seasonal tracks updated periodically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,Compete with global players on the 